OL,3,GNEWSAFridge thought to be cause of
OL,4,AKingston market fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire which destroyed a number of
OL,7,Fstalls at Kingston's Ancient Market and
OL,8,Fdamaged a number of nearby shops in the
OL,9,Fearly hours of Tuesday is thought to
OL,10,Fhave been started by a fridge with an
OL,11,Felectrical fault.
OL,13,FLondon Fire Brigade (LFB) said the
OL,14,Fsuspected faulty appliance "requires
OL,15,Ffurther verification" by an electrical
OL,16,Ftesting firm. It has not said where the
OL,17,Ffridge was located.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
