OL,3,GNEWSAFridge thought to be cause of
OL,4,AKingston market fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe LFB has already concluded the fire,
OL,7,Fin south-west London was "accidental"
OL,8,Fand the Metropolitan Police
OL,9,Finvestigation found the cause was "not
OL,10,Fsuspicious".
OL,12,FKingston Council said on Thursday "work
OL,13,Fto make the damaged buildings safe is
OL,14,Funder way" and the clean up "will
OL,15,Fcommence once it is safe to do so."
